{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24298","headline":"新亭病後独坐招李侍郎公垂 · 白居易","name":"新亭病後独坐招李侍郎公垂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新亭未有客，景日独何爲。\n趂暖泥茶竈，防寒夹竹篱。\n头风初定後，眼闇欲明时。\n浅把三分酒，闲题数句诗。\n应须置两榻，一榻待公垂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}